  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nI created this recipe to achieve clear and translucent rendering. Grading was used to enhance blues and cyans, and contrast was increased slightly to create a sharper image. This recipe is especially well suited to portrait photography under natural light, making the subject's skin appear more translucent. However, it can also be enjoyed in a variety of situations. Give it a try!",
